# Packages Cathedral adds on top of releng's list (base.x86_64).
# The build joins every packages/*.x86_64 file into the profile's packages.x86_64.
# Check each name with `pacman -Si <pkg>` before adding it.
#
# Milestone 1 (VM boot) adds nothing yet. The XFCE desktop goes in its own
# list (desktop-xfce.x86_64) at milestone 2, so swapping desktops is one file.
